      "id": "claim_4b6920d9ff924333ad480841fd509996",
      "statement": "chat_sft inherits max_seq_len, device_batch_size and total_batch_size from the base checkpoint metadata and embedding_lr, unembedding_lr and matrix_lr from its saved user_config unless flags override them, falling back to hard-coded defaults when the metadata lacks a value.",
