    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5c1b2886d423411bb182c9c4068751cf",
      "statement": "SFT builds the optimizer with weight_decay=0 and by default warm-starts it from the base checkpoint's per-rank optimizer shard, saving the fresh learning rates before load_state_dict and restoring them afterwards because the pretraining LRs had decayed to near zero; a missing shard produces a warning and a fresh optimizer.",
      "evidence": [
