      "statement": "The SFT training mixture is SmolTalk train plus --mmlu-epochs copies of MMLU auxiliary_train and --gsm8k-epochs copies of GSM8K train, validated on SmolTalk test plus MMLU test capped at 5200 rows and GSM8K test capped at 420 rows.",
