    {
      "id": "claim_ce8dee1142b14680a40244e74250a187",
      "statement": "The SFT packer renders conversations with render_conversation, best-fit packs them into rows of max_seq_len+1 and pads with BOS instead of cropping when nothing fits, then masks targets to -1 wherever the render mask is 0 and at padding positions so only assistant tokens contribute to the loss.",
