      "statement": "Training stops when --num-iterations is reached or when the consumed conversation count reaches the dataset size, the generator exposes approx_progress for a progress-based LR schedule (warmup ratio, constant, warmdown ratio to final fraction), and last_step is all-reduced with MAX each step so all ranks stop together.",
